{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Stone空间"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"Stone 空间"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p><strong>Stone 空间</strong>为满足如下等价条件的拓扑空间 $X$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$X$ 是<strong>全不连通</strong> (totally disconnected) "},{"Local":{"url":"紧Hausdorff空间","text":"紧 Hausdorff 空间"}},{"Plain":", 全不连通是指其连通分支仅有单点集;</li>\n<li>$X$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"凝聚位象","text":"凝聚"}},{"Plain":"的 Hausdorff 空间;</li>\n<li>$X$ 落在函子 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Boole}}(-,2)\\colon \\mathsf{Boole}^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathsf{CHaus}$ 的像中 (见 "},{"Local":{"url":"Stone对偶","text":"Stone 对偶"}},{"Plain":").</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}